    (comment 2 "Concept - see docs/hardware.md and hardware/bom-revA.csv"))
  (lib_symbols)
  (text "Variant OUT only - keep this block in one PCB area (zone OUTPUT_OPTION).\nF1 5 A fuse, D3 SMBJ33A, U5 12 V LDO (>= 36 V in) from VLOAD -> +12V_GATE.\nU6 UCC27524A dual low-side driver, Rg sized for ~100 ns edges.\nQ1/Q2 N-MOSFET 40 V, < 15 mOhm @ 10 V, >= 10 A; R11/R12 100k pull-downs on PWM.\nR9/R10 10 mOhm shunts, U7 dual comparator (trip ~3 A), open-drain -> OUT_FAULT_N.\nLOAD_GND joins GND at ONE star point near the shunts." (at 20 25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 9f810dbc-8ff1-4bad-8d58-b310ab56de05))
